                "a": "p(x) = x^2-8x-20 = (x-10)(x+2)\nq(x) = x^2-15x+50 = (x-10)(x-5)\nHCF = (x-10)\nLCM = (x-10)(x+2)(x-5)\nHCF × LCM = (x-10)^2(x+2)(x-5)\np(x) × q(x) = (x-10)(x+2)(x-10)(x-5)\nHCF × LCM = p(x) × q(x)"
