                "q": "For what value of 'p' and 'q', the expression x^4+8x^3+30x^2+px+q will be the perfect square?",
                "a": "x^4+8x^3+30x^2+px+q = (x^2+4x+7)^2\nx^4+8x^3+30x^2+56x+49\np = 56\nq = 49"
