                "q": "For what values of 'a' and 'b', x^4+4x^3+10x^2+ax+b will be the perfect square?",
                "a": "x^4+4x^3+10x^2+ax+b = (x^2+2x+3)^2\nx^4+4x^3+10x^2+12x+9\na = 12\nb = 9"
