                "a": "(i)\n13_5 = 1 × 5^1 + 3 × 5^0\n= 1 × 5 + 3 × 1\n= 5 + 3 = 8\n101_2 = 1 × 2^2 + 0 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 4 + 0 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 4 + 0 + 1 = 5\n31 - 8 - 5 = 18\n5 | 18\n| 3 - 3\n18 = 33_5\n(ii)\n31_5 = 3 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 3 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 15 + 1 = 16\n10_8 = 1 × 8^1 + 0 × 8^0\n= 1 × 8 + 0 × 1\n= 8 + 0 = 8\n65 - 16 - 8 = 41\n5 | 41\n5 | 8 - 1\n| 1 - 3\n41 = 131_5\n(iii)\n121_5 = 1 × 5^2 + 2 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 1 × 25 + 2 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 25 + 10 + 1 = 36\n111_2 = 1 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 4 + 2 + 1 = 7\n11_8 = 1 × 8^1 + 1 × 8^0\n= 1 × 8 + 1 × 1\n= 8 + 1 = 9\n71 - 36 - 7 - 9 = 19\n5 | 19\n| 3 - 4\n19 = 34_5\n(iv)\n100_5 = 1 × 5^2 + 0 × 5^1 + 0 × 5^0\n= 1 × 25 + 0 × 5 + 0 × 1\n= 25 + 0 + 0 = 25\n100_2 = 1 × 2^2 + 0 × 2^1 + 0 × 2^0\n= 1 × 4 + 0 × 2 + 0 × 1\n= 4 + 0 + 0 = 4\n100 - 25 - 4 = 71\n5 | 71\n5 | 14 - 1\n| 2 - 4\n71 = 241_5\n(v)\n1001_5 = 1 × 5^3 + 0 × 5^2 + 0 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 1 × 125 + 0 × 25 + 0 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 125 + 0 + 0 + 1 = 126\n1010_2 = 1 × 2^3 + 0 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 0 × 2^0\n= 1 × 8 + 0 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 0 × 1\n= 8 + 0 + 2 + 0 = 10\n100_8 = 1 × 8^2 + 0 × 8^1 + 0 × 8^0\n= 1 × 64 + 0 × 8 + 0 × 1\n= 64 + 0 + 0 = 64\n1000 - 126 - 10 - 64 = 800\n5 | 800\n5 | 160 - 0\n5 | 32 - 0\n5 | 6 - 2\n| 1 - 1\n800 = 11200_5"
