                "a": "Amount to be distributed = 1,520,000 − 30,000 − 50,000 = Rs 1,440,000\nMother's share = [[1/6]] × 1,440,000 = Rs 240,000\nWidow's share = [[1/8]] × 1,440,000 = Rs 180,000\nAmount left = 1,440,000 − 240,000 − 180,000 = Rs 1,020,000\nShare of a daughter = 1, share of a son = 2\nShares of 3 sons = 3 × 2 = 6\nShares of 4 daughters = 4 × 1 = 4\nSum of shares = 6 + 4 = 10\nEach son = [[2/10]] × 1,020,000 = Rs 204,000\nEach daughter = [[1/10]] × 1,020,000 = Rs 102,000"
