                "a": "(i)\nI = P × R × T\n= 20,000 × [[4/100]] × 5\n= 200 × 4 × 5\n= Rs 4,000\n(ii)\nI = P × R × T\n= 98,000 × [[6.5/100]] × 6\n= 980 × 6.5 × 6\n= Rs 38,220\n(iii)\nT = I ÷ (P × R)\nP × R = 21,000 × [[5/100]] = 1,050\nT = [[10,500/1,050]]\n= 10 years\n(iv)\nP = I ÷ (R × T)\nR × T = [[7/100]] × 6 = 0.42\nP = 2,100 ÷ 0.42\n= Rs 5,000\n(v)\nR = I ÷ (P × T)\nP × T = 5,800 × 3 = 17,400\nR = [[1,740/17,400]]\n= 0.10\n= 10%"
