                "q": "Identify polynomials from the following.\n(i) -1 (ii) [[3/y]] (iii) [[1/x]] - x (iv) √5 x + y (v) 5xy^3 (vi) 2 - x (vii) [[√1/3]] (viii) [[1/x^2 + 3]] (ix) x^2 + 3x - 1 (x) 3^5 + [[4/x]] (xi) ax^2 + bx + c (xii) 2a^2 + 3a + 1",
                "a": "(i) -1\nConstant\nYes\n(ii) [[3/y]]\n= 3y^-1\nNo\n(iii) [[1/x]] - x\n= x^-1 - x\nNo\n(iv) √5 x + y\nx: 1, y: 1\nYes\n(v) 5xy^3\nx: 1, y: 3\nYes\n(vi) 2 - x\nx: 1\nYes\n(vii) [[√1/3]]\n= [[1/3]]\nYes\n(viii) [[1/x^2 + 3]]\n= (x^2 + 3)^-1\nNo\n(ix) x^2 + 3x - 1\nx: 2, 1, 0\nYes\n(x) 3^5 + [[4/x]]\n= 3^5 + 4x^-1\nNo\n(xi) ax^2 + bx + c\nx: 2, 1, 0\nYes\n(xii) 2a^2 + 3a + 1\na: 2, 1, 0\nYes"
