                "q": "Recognize and write types of the following polynomials as linear, quadratic, cubic or biquadratic.\n(i) x + 2y (ii) 3x - 5 (iii) 2xy + [[y/5]] (iv) y^2 + y - 3 (v) x^3 + xy + 5 (vi) x^4 - 2x^3 + [[1/2]] (vii) x^3 + x^2 + √4 (viii) 5x^4 (ix) -9xy^2 (x) x^2 + 2x^2 y^2 + y^2 (xi) x^2 - x (xii) 3xy^2 z^3",
                "a": "(i) x + 2y\n1\nLinear\n(ii) 3x - 5\n1\nLinear\n(iii) 2xy + [[y/5]]\n2\nQuadratic\n(iv) y^2 + y - 3\n2\nQuadratic\n(v) x^3 + xy + 5\n3\nCubic\n(vi) x^4 - 2x^3 + [[1/2]]\n4\nBiquadratic\n(vii) x^3 + x^2 + √4\n√4 = 2\n3\nCubic\n(viii) 5x^4\n4\nBiquadratic\n(ix) -9xy^2\n1 + 2 = 3\nCubic\n(x) x^2 + 2x^2 y^2 + y^2\n2 + 2 = 4\nBiquadratic\n(xi) x^2 - x\n2\nQuadratic\n(xii) 3xy^2 z^3\n1 + 2 + 3 = 6\n6"
