                "a": "(i) 6^2 ÷ 3^3 = 36 ÷ 27 = [[4/3]]\n(ii) 5^0 ÷ 5^-2 × 5^2 = 1 ÷ [[1/25]] × 25 = 25 × 25 = 625 = 5^4\n(iii) {([[2/5]])^2}^3 ÷ ([[2/5]])^4 × ([[2/5]])^3 = ([[2/5]])^(2×3) ÷ ([[2/5]])^4 × ([[2/5]])^3 = ([[2/5]])^(6−4+3) = ([[2/5]])^5 = [[32/3125]]",
                "q": "5. Simplify:\n(i) 6^2 ÷ 3^3   (ii) 5^0 ÷ 5^-2 × 5^2\n(iii) {([[2/5]])^2}^3 ÷ ([[2/5]])^4 × ([[2/5]])^3"
